        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/4491bb/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-03-16T13:08:48.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I ordered Shattered Timelines and a bunch of the mini-expansions from Greater Than Games' website about a week ago. &nbsp;My order has since not moved from the status of payment recieved. &nbsp;Since I bought most of my other Sentinels products from Amazon I really have no idea what to expect in terms of time line for this order. &nbsp;So I guess I am just trying to find out at what point should I start wondering if something has gone wrong? &nbsp;I am not really worried yet I realize it's a smaller company dealing with a crazy rush. &nbsp;I just don't want to be that guy who freaks too early and annoys people. &nbsp;I also don't want to be the guy who freaks too late and then it's a complicated mess to straighten out his order because stuff has fallen off the system. &nbsp;(I have worked in a warehouse before and I have seen both happen.)</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
