        "created_at": "2013-03-16T13:24:20.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>No u donnt have to worry I ordered mine 2 weeks ago but it hasnt shipped yet. The reason being they are shipping the are shipping the product to all there kickstarter backers first then to those who placed orders on there website. The good news is that Paul said they finished all the kickstarters yesterday and that this weekend they will begin packing the website orders so I would think the website ones should be arriving in a week or 2</p>",
