        "cooked": "<p>less - the kickstarter orders took on average 2-3 days to arrive.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Now that they have finally cleared out all that space in their warehouse (They only have a small one, and the 2000+Kickstarter orders + the distribution center orders for FLGS +the stock on hand &nbsp;for their own webstore + the extras needed for replacement cards..... you can imagine that warehouse was STUFFED) theyll be working asap on the website orders. - expect yours by the middle of next week! (business days :P)</p>",
